# Let the WLBT driver recover a failed Wi-Fi/BT firmware by itself: it
# powers the chip down and restarts both services without a reboot.
# 0, not 2: mode 2 follows /sys/wifi/memdump, which this kernel never
# creates, so it would keep recovery off.
# Same trigger as init.wlbt_modules.rc; init runs it first (file name
# order), so every service open already sees recovery on.
on post-fs
    write /sys/module/scsc_mx/parameters/disable_recovery_handling 0
